Decision rule (dec 061 item 3):
 - not V -> INVALID (no verdict, not a strike). V as in Addenda A-E incl. the correction-1 add-on (8 traces with summary + >= 1 root
   usage-bearing entry).
 - LOOP-REDUCED if V AND F has 0 tasks with max identical consecutive call run >= 5 (D had 2: 18 and 20) AND F empty <= 4/8 AND
   F-empty-only (vs D) <= 2.
 - HARM if (V and) F empty >= 5/8 or F-empty-only >= 3. (HARM is checked before LOOP-REDUCED; they cannot both hold.)
 - otherwise NO-EFFECT.
